[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d14_appendix_c"
title = "Appendix C — equipment schedule"
byline = "attached to the FY1966 procurement request"
hand = 0
body = "WORK UNIT 1615-C — INSTALLED EQUIPMENT

C-1  Schedule luminaire, 150W, dimmer
     driven. Three off, chambers A/B/C.
     The imposed signal.

C-2  Program timeclock, cam driven, 24 hr
     drum, three channels. Drives C-1.

C-3  Observer intercom, two channel,
     talk and monitor.

C-4  Chart recorder bank, six pen, 12 in
     paper. Temperature, activity,
     respiration, per subject.

C-5  Immersion tank, 8 ft x 4 ft,
     thermostatted. Severe condition.

C-6  Photometer, portable. Certification
     of C-1 output, quarterly.

C-7  Door interlock cabinet, three
     channel, key released.

C-8  Tape deck, 1/4 in, 3 3/4 ips, and
     reel library. Observer channel.

C-9  Ration store, staged and rotated,
     14 day units.

C-10 Emergency generator, 30 kW diesel,
     and battery bank.

JUSTIFICATION

Items C-1 and C-2 are the experimental
condition and are not substitutable. C-6 is
required because a schedule made of light is
worthless if the lamp drifts. C-7 is required
by Protocol 4.4. The remainder are ordinary
provision for a facility of this occupancy.

                              M. KETCH"
